# Split Group Alert Component

Stateful alert management system that tracks and triggers notifications for split hash transitions and controller changes.

## Key Integration Pattern
Edge-triggered alerting pattern that fires once per state transition, preventing duplicate notifications during sustained alert conditions.

## Important Constraints
- All alert types use mutex-based thread safety for concurrent updates
- Alert state persists until the triggering condition resolves
- Hash alerts support initial, recovery, and unknown state detection patterns